    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Roll is a difficult physics-based platformer where you play as a bouncy, spherical robot. Instead of jumping, you'll have to slam into the ground to boost yourself past obstacles. The game is still in development, but a demo of the first world is currently available for free!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features for the full release:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 or more worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 16 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More bosses and a continuation of the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to wishlist the game so you don't miss out on the full release!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Roll is a difficult physics-based platformer where you play as a bouncy, spherical robot. Instead of jumping, you'll have to slam into the ground to boost yourself past obstacles. The game is still in development, but a demo of the first world is currently available for free!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features for the full release:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 or more worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 16 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More bosses and a continuation of the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to wishlist the game so you don't miss out on the full release!</p>",
    "short_description": "Project Roll is a difficult physics-based platformer with a twist: there's no jump button! Instead, you'll speed through levels by slamming into the ground and bouncing over obstacles! The game was designed with speedrunning in mind, and features time trial levels where you can compete globally!",
